=== L1. Contraction identities for generic algebraic curvature tensors ===
  [True] n = 3, signature 3,0 (6 free components): C1 = (n+2)|R|^2, C2 = 3/4 |R|^2 + (n+3)/2 |Ric|^2, hence 4(n+2) C2 - 3 C1 = 2(n+2)(n+3)|Ric|^2  [20 s]
  [True] n = 3, signature 1,2 (6 free components): C1 = (n+2)|R|^2, C2 = 3/4 |R|^2 + (n+3)/2 |Ric|^2, hence 4(n+2) C2 - 3 C1 = 2(n+2)(n+3)|Ric|^2  [20 s]
  [True] n = 4, signature 4,0 (20 free components): C1 = (n+2)|R|^2, C2 = 3/4 |R|^2 + (n+3)/2 |Ric|^2, hence 4(n+2) C2 - 3 C1 = 2(n+2)(n+3)|Ric|^2  [20 s]
